{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sUYZjW6Igj1793574993.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>巴西聖保羅市有民眾集會慶祝盧拉連任總統，並抗議落敗的弗拉維奧出走到美國。</p><p></p><p>盧拉勝出大選一周後，聖保羅市周日有民眾上街慶祝。活動充滿節慶氣氛，有森巴樂隊在舞台上演奏。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BRAZ.PROTEST_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Z1P9Intzq51793574983.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>亦有市民不滿，被指控接受外國資金和操縱社交媒體的弗拉維奧出走到美國，並憂慮弗拉維奧可能會在美國政治支持下嘗試發動政變。美國總統特朗普較早時表示，弗拉維奧可以無限期留在美國，但他暫時未有計劃會晤弗拉維奧。路透社引述消息指，特朗普未有支持弗拉維奧政治活動的計劃。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.232054+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T23:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T19:26:47.371526+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:42.647010+00:00","content_hash":"7fbcbb8fae7e73b48ca24e61d49972375daa9bc71cb3bbe2fd3455334e9dd339","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.232054+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}